      {
        "id": "scaling-definition",
        "moduleId": "scaling-matrix-core",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "三维缩放的定义与矩阵",
        "markdown": "三维缩放是二维缩放向三维的简单扩充：对点 $P = (x, y, z)$，只要在变换矩阵中引入 $z$ 坐标的缩放参数 $s_z$，就得到相对于坐标原点的缩放矩阵 $S(s_x, s_y, s_z)$，其对角线为 $s_x$、$s_y$、$s_z$，第四行第四列为 1，其余元素为 0。于是 $P' = S P$，逐分量写为 $x' = s_x x$、$y' = s_y y$、$z' = s_z z$，其中 $s_x$、$s_y$、$s_z$ 是给定的任意正值。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000307"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "三维缩放"
              ],
              "lineStart": 8783,
              "lineEnd": 8874,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0003/images/5d72659df265ac31b1ea154cfb711489dde162ceddac3ae74d1c0e9783b8499b.jpg",
